000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     SEAAPPIQ.
000400 AUTHOR.         C HILLES/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   11/5/87.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*D   ELECTRONIC APPROVAL SYSTEM - APPROVAL STATUS INQUIRY.
001100*D   THIS SHOWS FOR ANY REQ ALL THE APPROVALS IT IS WAITING FOR.
      *C
      *C   05/05/94  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO ALLOW 'SS' STATUS REQUISITIONS
      *C     THAT HAVE THE AUTHORIZATION FLAG SET VIA MP1 TO BE
      *C     HANDLED.
      *C
      *C   10/08/2002   GEISER
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO PRINT A KICKSTART REPORT TO A
      *C     PRINTER NUMBER AS SUPPLIED BY THE USER.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
DCR01 *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
DCR01 *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSEAAPPIQ CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
DCR01 *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
DCR01 *****************************************************************
      *C
001200
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DREQQUE-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT PER-PERSONNEL-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
DCR01             ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSEAAPPIQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

001700
001800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DREQQUE-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DREQQUE-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4400  OF MCFLCS4401.

       FD  PER-PERSONNEL-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PER-PERSONNEL-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPMM0300  OF MCFLMM0301.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(2000).

001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002000
002100 77  SUB                           PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
002200 77  SUB1                          PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
002300 77  SUB2                          PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
002400 77  SWITCH-FLAG                   PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
002500 77  MORE-ENTRIES-FLAG             PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
002600 77  FIRST-SCRN-FLAG               PIC X(1)  VALUE "Y".
002700 77  REQ-DELETED-FLAG              PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
